{
  "name": "dsh-paper-studio-v3",
  "version": "3.2.54",
  "description": "论文插件 V3：把「论文方案」（论文框架 + 方法论 + 工作流）做成对话驱动、无面板、双模式的写作编排层。**跨宿主**：DSH 侧是两个原生工具（paper_studio / paper_dev，用户模式下写入真被拒）；另有**零依赖 MCP 服务器**（bin/mcp-server.mjs），Codex / Claude Code / Cursor 等任何 MCP 宿主可接入；判据只有一份（dist/plugin.js 的 __test__ + 已冻结的 paper-studio CLI），换宿主不产生第二套说法。含 paper_progress 工具：宿主没有原生目标机制时用它顶住长任务（避免每步停下等人催）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/plugin.js",
  "bin": {
    "paper-studio-mcp": "./bin/mcp-server.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "bin",
    "skill",
    "adapters",
    "hub",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "mcp",
    "model-context-protocol",
    "codex",
    "claude-code",
    "host-agnostic",
    "paper",
    "academic-writing",
    "paper-studio",
    "no-panel",
    "dual-mode"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/liuhaolong16/dsh-paper-studio.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/liuhaolong16/dsh-paper-studio#readme"
}
